rule EmailCriticality
	lineageTag: 715b2ef6-b7f8-5506-a153-11dcf03bf6a2
	statement: An email is critical if it affects the completion date, the budget or the scope of its project, or if it contradicts an assumption or clause in the specification, offer or contract of that project. An email that only needs to be monitored is rated watch. All other emails are rated not critical.
	ruleReferencedEntity Email
	ruleReferencedEntity ProjectDocument
	ruleReferencedRelationship 'Email About Project'
	ruleReferencedRelationship 'Document Of Project'
